<title>ITALY: Italy authority to meet ENI/ENEL on venture.</title>
<headline>Italy authority to meet ENI/ENEL on venture.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's electricity and gas authority will meet with the heads of energy giant ENI and electricity group ENEL next week following the announcement of a joint ENI/ENEL venture.</p>
<p>Earlier this week, the two groups announced an agreement to set up Italy's largest independent electricity production company.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
